# Unicode CLDR 47, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/sw/dateFields.json.  "mwezi
# {0} uliopita" in the singular and "miezi {0} iliyopita" in the plural: mwezi
# is class 3/4, so unlike the N-class units it DOES change shape for number,
# and the plural miezi is what a count above one stands beside.
mwezi
miezi
